                <mxCell id="3" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" parent="2" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry width="790" height="347.58620689655174" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="4" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Functional requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;1. authentication: users can authenticate with the most minimal way using phones or email, the experience should be as easy as possible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;2. customer support &amp;amp; communication with users: users can easily contact us using the application, report problems and suggest additions or features, they can view their cases, and we have a way to view them from our panel, and there&#39;s a chat between us through the application and our admin panel&lt;br&gt;3. domain suggestions: users can suggest blacklist or whiltelist domains, and we should have a way to view them and give them labels from the admin panel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;4. protection backdoor: there should be a way for us through the admin panel to disable protection on some users, or on all users in emergency cases, and the applications should respond to those events, and users can renable protection on their devices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;5. support: users can support us through recurring payments&lt;br&gt;6. dns: the final db of blacklist and whitelist for domains is different than the one the api is using, and we should be able to update it through the admin panel based on the suggestions of the users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="2" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="10" y="18.620689655172413" width="370" height="322.7586206896552" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="5" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Non-functional requirements&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1. scalability: should be easily scalable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2. availability: should be always available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3. latency: shouldn&#39;t be a bad experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;4. consistency: all data should be synced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5. calculations: normal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="2" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="420" y="99.3103448275862" width="350" height="186.20689655172416" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
